Circuit connection table:

| Component              | Component Pin         | ESP32-S3 Pin       | Notes                          |
| -----------------------| --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------ |
| **HX711 Amplifier**    | VCC                   | 3.3V               | Power supply                   |
