|                        | SCK                   | GPIO 2             | Clock signal                   |
| **Load Cell to HX711** | Red Wire              | E+                 | Excitation positive            |
|                        | Black Wire            | E-                 | Excitation negative            |
|                        | White Wire            | A-                 | Signal negative                |
|                        | Green Wire            | A+                 | Signal positive                |
